.TH ARCH_PRCTL_PTR 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
arch_prctl_ptr \- invoke arch_prctl with a pointer argument
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/arch_prctl.h>
.B int arch_prctl_ptr(int operation, void *argument);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Invokes x86-64 arch_prctl with a pointer argument, for example ARCH_GET_FS.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR arch_prctl (3crunch),
.BR arch_prctl (2)
